    "raw_question_evidence_excerpt_en": "The two prototypes used different pots. One was dark and narrow, while the other was wide and shiny. That makes any difference difficult to interpret. We'll use identical containers with the same starting volume of water, and record their mass before testing. That should reduce an unnecessary source of variation. We can discuss design-specific containers in a separate test later.",
